# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Paste your browser Cookie header on ONE line, right after the = below.
#
#  How to get it: logged into the catalog, open DevTools → Network → click any
#  request to publicdatacatalog.rarediseasesnetwork.org → Request Headers →
#  copy the entire "Cookie:" value (it includes the _shibsession_ cookie).
#
#  ⚠️  This is a live login session — a secret. Don't commit or share it.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

CATALOG_COOKIE=

# Optional: spot-check one dataset by slug (leave commented to just list all)
# CATALOG_DATASET=
